<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr CPI 14.9 pct in July vs 15.3 June.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr CPI 14.9 pct in July vs 15.3 June.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish consumer prices fell 0.2 percent in July against a 1.5 percent rise in June, bringing year-on-year inflation down to 14.9 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Consumer prices rose 8.0 percent in the January-July period, compared with a 11.3 percent rise in the corresponding period last year.  </p>
<p> POLISH CONSUMER PRICES    JULY 97   JUNE 97	JULY 96</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)   -0.2	 1.5	    -0.1</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)	   14.9	15.3	    20.4</p>
<p> services m/m change	   1.1	 0.9	     1.5</p>
<p> services yr/yr change	19.2	19.7	    19.2</p>
<p> food prices m/m change     -2.5	 2.9	    -1.9</p>
<p> food prices yr/yr change   13.0	14.2	    19.6</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
